# Cloudflare Pages headers.
#
# PGlite persists to IndexedDB, which needs no cross-origin isolation — that is exactly why
# we did not pick OPFS. Do NOT add COOP/COEP here unless someone deliberately moves storage
# to OPFS SyncAccessHandle, and then re-test in the ChatGPT in-app browser first.
#
# The CSP enforces NFR-PRIV-01 rather than intending it. Not theoretical: drei pulls in
# troika-three-text, whose font resolver hard-codes jsdelivr — measured seven requests, one named
# font-files/vietnamese/..., so the URL itself discloses the reader's language.
#
# wasm-unsafe-eval permits wasm compilation only, not eval(); PGlite will not start without it.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'wasm-unsafe-eval'; worker-src 'self' blob:; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob:; font-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'
